<title>USA: Albuquerque, N.M., won by Bear Stearns. [CORRECTED 19:33 GMT]</title>
<headline>Albuquerque, N.M., won by Bear Stearns. [CORRECTED 19:33 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co., said it won $18.345 million of Albuquerque, N.M., gross receipts tax refunding revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.125 percent.</p>
<p>(Corrects winner of tender and TIC).</p>
</text>
